ifa/issues/156 (was 171) -- a {int64, float64} union closed through a loop over one shared int.__mul__ contour sustains itself: all four `2*x` edges carry identical actuals, so no type-keyed split separates the int ones from the float one, and numeric coercion then widens a/b to float. Compiles with no diagnostics and prints 2.0 where CPython prints 2. Flips to PASS when the analysis separates the edges.
